{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27807","headline":"和邢郎中病中重阳强游乐游原 · 裴夷直","name":"和邢郎中病中重阳强游乐游原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉晨令节共陶陶，风景牵情并不劳。\n晓日整冠兰室静，秋原骑马菊花高。\n晴光一一呈金刹，诗思浸浸逼水曹。\n何必销忧凭外物，祗将清韵敌春醪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}